<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/smtp"><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: host;"><label for="field-UID">SMTP Host</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="host" placeholder="127.0.0.1" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="127.0.0.1" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The hostname or IP address of your SMTP server.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: port;"><label for="field-UID">SMTP Port</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="port" placeholder="25" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="25" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The port number for your SMTP server. Common ports: 25 (default), 587 (TLS), 465 (SSL).</p></div><div class="form-field select-field " data-type="select" style="--grid-area: secure;" data-settings="{&quot;clearValue&quot;:false}"><label for="field-UID">Encryption</label><div class="form-group"><select id="field-UID" name="secure" aria-describedby="help-UID"><option value="tls">TLS</option><option value="ssl">SSL</option><option value>None</option></select><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The encryption method to use for SMTP connection.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: username;"><label for="field-UID">SMTP Username</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="username" placeholder="username@example.com" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Username for SMTP authentication (if required).</p></div><div class="form-field secret-field " data-type="secret" style="--grid-area: password;"><label for="field-UID">SMTP Password</label><div class="form-group"><input type="password" id="field-UID" name="password" placeholder="••••••••" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="off" data-1p-ignore data-lpignore="true"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Password for SMTP authentication (if required).</p></div><div class="form-field email-field " data-type="email" style="--grid-area: from;"><label for="field-UID">From Address</label><div class="form-group"><input type="email" id="field-UID" name="from" inputmode="email" placeholder="from@example.com" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill" autocapitalize="off"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The email address that emails will be sent from.</p></div><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: fromName;"><label for="field-UID">From Name</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="fromName" placeholder="My Company" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The name that will appear as the sender.</p></div><div class="form-field email-field " data-type="email" style="--grid-area: to;"><label for="field-UID">Default To Address</label><div class="form-group"><input type="email" id="field-UID" name="to" inputmode="email" placeholder="to@example.com" aria-describedby="help-UID" autocomplete="nofill" autocapitalize="off"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Default recipient email address for test emails.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: sendDelay;"><label for="field-UID">Send Delay (ms)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="sendDelay" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="0" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="0" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Delay in milliseconds between emails during bulk sending. Use to avoid SMTP rate limits. 0 = no delay.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: maxPerHour;"><label for="field-UID">Max Emails Per Hour</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="maxPerHour" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="0" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="0" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Maximum number of emails that can be sent per hour. Queued emails will wait until the next hour when the limit is reached. 0 = unlimited.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: maxPerDay;"><label for="field-UID">Max Emails Per Day</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="maxPerDay" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="0" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="0" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Maximum number of emails that can be sent per day. Queued emails will wait until the next day when the limit is reached. 0 = unlimited.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>